Alpine repository signing key

Files
  naos-apk.rsa: RSA private key for signing APK packages and repository indexes.
  naos-apk.rsa.pub: matching public key installed in /etc/apk/keys on clients.
  The public filename must match the name recorded in the APK signature.

Generate in a new, empty directory
  umask 077
  openssl genrsa -out naos-apk.rsa 4096
  openssl rsa -in naos-apk.rsa -pubout -out naos-apk.rsa.pub
  chmod 600 naos-apk.rsa
  chmod 644 naos-apk.rsa.pub

Check the key pair
  openssl rsa -in naos-apk.rsa -check -noout
  openssl rsa -in naos-apk.rsa -pubout -outform DER | sha256sum
  openssl pkey -pubin -in naos-apk.rsa.pub -outform DER | sha256sum

The two public-key digests must match.
